claim.claim-text:
R- is selected from the group consisting of hydrogen, alkyl, alkoxy, halogen, aminoalkyl and nitro; 

Ar is selected from naphthyl, wherein naphthyl is optionally substituted with from one to three substituents independently selected from C,-C8 alkyl, C.-Cg alkoxy, fluorinated C,-C8 alkyl, fluorinated C C8 alkoxy, halogen, cyano, hydroxy, amino, nitro, C C4 alkylamino, C,-C4 dialkylamino, wherein the alkyl groups may be the same or different; or phenyl, wherein phenyl is optionally substituted with from one to three substituents independently selected from C,- C8 alkyl, C C8 alkoxy, fluorinated C C8 alkyl, fluorinated C,-C8 alkoxy, C C8 aralkyl (wherein optionally the alkyl or aryl portions are independently substituted and the alkyl portion may be substituted with at least one fluorine and/or the aryl portion may be independently substituted with from one to two substituents selected from halogen, C,-C4 alkyl, C1-C6 alkylthio or hydroxyl), C C8 aralkoxy wherein optionally the alkoxy or aryl portions are independently substituted and the alkoxy portion may be substituted with at least one fluorine and/or the aryl portion may be independently substituted with from one to two substituents selected from halogen, C C4 alkyl, C C6 alkylthio or hydroxyl), halogen, cyano, hydroxy, amino, nitro, C C8 alkylamino, C C4 dialkylamino (wherein the alkyl groups may be the same or different), 

 alkylsulfonyl, C C8 alkylthio, C1-C8 alkylsulfinyl, heteroaryl, a second phenyl (wherein the second phenyl is optionally substituted with from one to two substituents independently selected from C C4 alkyl, C1-C4 alkoxy, fluorinated C1-C4 alkyl, fluorinated C C4 alkoxy, halogen, cyano, hydroxy, amino, nitro, C C4 alkylamino, C1-C4 dialkylamino [wherein the alkyl groups may be the same or different], C,-C4 alkylsulfonyl, C C4 alkylthio, or C1-C4 alkylsulfinyl;

Ar is phenyl, wherein phenyl is optionally substituted with from one to three substituents independently selected from 0,-Cg alkyl, C C8 alkoxy, fluorinated C C8 alkyl, fluorinated C,-C8 alkoxy, C,-C8 aralkyl (wherein optionally the alkyl or aryl portions are independently substituted and the alkyl portion may be substituted with at least one fluorine and/or the aryl portion may be independently substituted with from one to two substituents selected from halogen, CrC4 alkyl, C C6 alkylthio or hydroxyl), CrC8 aralkoxy wherein optionally the alkoxy or aryl portions are independently substituted and the 

alkoxy portion may be substituted with at least one fluorine and/or the aryl portion may be independently substituted with from one to two substituents selected from halogen, CrC4 alkyl, 0,-Ce alkylthio or hydroxyl), halogen, cyano, hydroxy, amino, nitro, C C8 alkylamino, C,-C4 dialkylamino (wherein the alkyl groups may be the same or different), 

 alkylsulfonyl, C C8 alkylthio, CrC8 alkylsulfinyl, heteroaryl, a second phenyl (wherein the second phenyl is optionally substituted with from one to two substituents independently selected from C C4 alkyl, C C4 alkoxy, fluorinated CrC4 alkyl, fluorinated C C4 alkoxy, halogen, cyano, hydroxy, amino, nitro, CrC4 alkylamino, C1-C4 dialkylamino [wherein the alkyl groups may be the same or different], C C4 alkylsulfonyl, C,- C4 alkylthio, or C C4 alkylsulfinyl;
